msgctxt "728"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "749"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "759"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "765"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "786"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "818"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "853"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "881"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "901"
msgid "Cool! That'll be %s!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "922"
msgid ""
"A popular after-work drink. It charges up your Heat \n"
"and health a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"One of our most popular products. It'll charge up your\n"
"Heat a bit."
msgstr ""
"Uno dei nostri prodotti più popolari. Ricaricherà un po' il tuo Furore."

msgctxt "1063"
msgid ""
"You like that black umbrella? You could probably use\n"
"it for a weapon. Hell, my pops was a beast with one."
msgstr ""
"Ti piace quell'ombrello nero? Probabilmente potresti usarlo come arma. "
"Cavolo, mio padre era un mostro con un aggeggio del genere."

msgctxt "1169"
msgid ""
"This smells so bad, it might save your ass in a fight. \n"
"Just leave it behind when you go to the club!"
msgstr ""
"Questo puzza così tanto che potrebbe salvarti il culo in una rissa.  "
"Lascialo a casa quando vai in discoteca!"

msgctxt "1271"
msgid ""
"I thought this bloody cloth might come in handy for \n"
"something, so I set it aside. Kinda gross though, isn't\n"
"it...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1387"
msgid "Not sure what this tiny suspension is for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1430"
msgid ""
"Someone from my clan brought this stuff in, but the\n"
"bigger mystery is how he got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1515"
msgid ""
"An old, rusty bell. Its melancholy sound brings people\n"
"down a little when it rings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1599"
msgid ""
"Not much to say about this worn-out pillow, except\n"
"that it makes a pretty good cushion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1687"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Rage Sack. Push the button, and it'll scream \n"
"obscenities. Great for parties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1773"
msgid ""
"Kind of an odd looking blow-up doll. I'm sure you \n"
"know what it's for..."
msgstr ""
"Una bambola gonfiabile dall'aspetto un po' strano. Sono sicuro che sai a "
"cosa serve..."

msgctxt "1846"
msgid ""
"Might be able to use this thing if I can get it fixed. \n"
"The circuit board it uses is hard to come by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1948"
msgid ""
"This small kettle's only good for boiling a little water \n"
"at a time. Some married man brought it in. Said it \n"
"used to be his lucky charm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2086"
msgid ""
"A weird-looking, blue fluorescent bulb. Probably not\n"
"something you'd use for most lights."
msgstr ""
"Una strana lampadina blu fluorescente. Probabilmente non è qualcosa che "
"useresti per l'illuminazione normale."

msgctxt "2176"
msgid ""
"That old magazine? You wanna read the comics or \n"
"something? Take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2245"
msgid ""
"This resin can be used for a lot of things, but I have \n"
"no clue where it came from. It hasn't killed anyone \n"
"yet, though, so it's probably safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2390"
msgid ""
"This special alloy wire can be used for a number of \n"
"things... in construction, at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2480"
msgid ""
"This chunk of metal has some serious magnetic pull. \n"
"Maybe you can use it for something."
msgstr ""
"Questo pezzo di metallo ha una notevole attrazione magnetica. Forse puoi "
"usarlo per qualcosa."

msgctxt "2569"
msgid "It's a dropper. What else can I say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2606"
msgid ""
"This is an artificial bouquet. I tried to give it to a \n"
"woman, but she hated it. I guess it's no substitute \n"
"for real flowers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2733"
msgid ""
"This is an old suspension we ripped out of a car. It's\n"
"old, but it's still pretty damn nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2826"
msgid ""
"This shard of tempered glass came from a car. It's \n"
"actually bulletproof. Good luck blocking anything \n"
"with it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2946"
msgid ""
"This alloy spring is a good product. Great for fixing \n"
"upholstery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3013"
msgid ""
"I thought this Super Resilient Resin would sell well\n"
"to counter all that \"low-resilience\" crap you see \n"
"everywhere. Boy was I wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3148"
msgid ""
"Shines with all seven colors of the rainbow. Nice,\n"
"right? I'll sell it for cheap."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3230"
msgid ""
"What's so \"super\" about it, you ask? Well, use it and\n"
"you'll find out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3301"
msgid ""
"Oh, the rubber hose. That dumbass Nishida thought \n"
"we needed it to clean up, but now it's just sitting \n"
"there rotting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3420"
msgid ""
"An old woman left this peculiar White Lotus Comb \n"
"behind years ago. I've never seen another like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3521"
msgid ""
"That driver's got a colorful history, but it ain't for \n"
"hittin' golf balls. Only got one of these."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3620"
msgid ""
"This brooch has the Yin dragon on it. Usually, you can\n"
"only get these at the Coliseum, so let's keep this \n"
"between you and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3747"
msgid ""
"This brooch has the Yang dragon on it. Usually, you \n"
"can only get these at the Coliseum, so let's keep this\n"
"between you and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3875"
msgid ""
"This brooch has a dragon engraved in red stone. \n"
"Usually, you can only score something like this at \n"
"the Coliseum, so keep quiet about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4014"
msgid ""
"This brooch has a rising dragon engraved on it. \n"
"Usually, you can only score something like this at\n"
"the Coliseum, so keep quiet about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4152"
msgid ""
"A powerful dragon is engraved on this brooch. \n"
"Usually, you can only get these at the Coliseum,\n"
"so let's keep this between you and me."
msgstr ""
